Copyright 2012 The B612 Project Authors (https://github.com/polarsys/b612)

This file is a subset of b612, made by "modustool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126, the characters U+00A0 to U+00FF, the characters U+20AC,
the characters that the font service draws on demand, U+0391 to U+039F U+03A1 to U+03A1 U+03A3 to U+03A9 U+03B1 to U+03C0 U+03C2 to U+03C9,
and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(0 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables; the 878 pair adjustments of its table kern between
these characters. The subset carries the name "B612 ASCII".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, no Reserved Font Name.

